sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as Android UI (Onboarding/Today/Trend)
    participant SVC as PassiveSensingService
    participant SCH as SensingWindowScheduler
    participant COL as Collectors (Sensor/Screen/AppActivity/Mic)
    participant HUB as SensingEventHub
    participant NLS as NotificationCollector (系统绑定)
    participant FE as FeatureExtractor
    participant REPO as LocalRepository
    participant ROOM as Room (SQLCipher v4)
    participant WB as WorkManager SyncWorker
    participant API as FastAPI /v1/*
    participant SVCB as Backend Services (profile/safety/audit/sandbox)

    Note over UI,SVC: 1) 启动（consent + flag fail-closed + 权限门控）
    UI->>REPO: saveConsent(passive_sensing, true)
    UI->>SVC: PassiveSensingService.start()
    SVC->>SCH: start(scope)
    Note over NLS,HUB: 2) 通知数据共享层
    NLS-->>HUB: onNotificationPosted → hub.offer(ts,pkg,category)

    loop 每 5 分钟 (window)
        SCH->>COL: snapshot() / MicCollector.snapshotAndClear()
        SCH->>HUB: snapshotAndClear()
        SCH->>FE: extractFromCollectors(windowStart, windowEnd, ..., hub 快照)
        FE-->>SCH: DerivedFeatureInput(+sources_present)
        SCH->>REPO: saveDerivedFeature(input)
        REPO->>REPO: SafetyEngine.evaluatePassive(summary)
        REPO->>ROOM: insertFeatureVector + enqueue(derived_feature)
        alt severity == RED
            REPO->>REPO: enqueueEscalation(passive_red_signal)
            REPO-->>UI: passiveSafety StateFlow → SafetyScreen
        end
    end

    Note over WB,API: 3) 上行
    WB->>WB: pendingOutbox()（410 类型删除+标记 deprecated）
    WB->>API: POST /v1/features/ingest (Bearer + X-Request-ID)
    API->>SVCB: require_feature_flag(fail-closed) + consent 412 + 幂等 ingest
    SVCB->>SVCB: evaluate_passive → RiskSignal / Escalation
    API-->>WB: 200 / 409 幂等

    Note over API,SVCB: 4) 只读查询（无读副作用）
    UI->>API: GET /v1/narratives?from=&to=
    UI->>API: GET /v1/profile/{user_id} (只读缓存)
    API->>SVCB: 时间范围查询（window_start 索引）

    Note over API,SVCB: 5) Skill 执行反馈闭环
    UI->>REPO: recordSkillCompletion(input)
    REPO->>ROOM: enqueue(skill_completion)
    WB->>API: POST /v1/skills/completions (signed-only 校验)
    API->>SVCB: audit skill.completion + 幂等落库

    Note over API,SVCB: 6) 运维/安全
    admin-->>API: POST /v1/sandbox/runs (子进程隔离 + 真超时)
    admin-->>API: POST /v1/data-subject-requests/{id}/complete (分类矩阵删除)
    API->>SVCB: audit append (tenant-scoped 串行化 + request-id)
